---
description: Pipeline order from Figma to deployed apps; which generator owns which file
alwaysApply: true
---

# Pipeline (always in this order; never hand-edit a generated file)

1. **Extract** `fig2design` → `fixtures/figma/*` (source `.fig` stays OUTSIDE the repo, e.g. `/workspace/fig-fixtures/saas.fig`).
2. **Content** `bun run content` → `fixtures/content/records` (@ui8kit/contract records), `bun run contract` validates.
3. **Views** `bun tools/views.ts` → `fixtures/views/*.json` (block view models, shared by both runtimes).
4. **Tokens** edit `fixtures/tokens/mapping.json` → `bun run tokens` → `packages/tokens/theme.css` + app `brand.css`; `bun run brand:emit && bun run brand:check`.
5. **Primitives** `cd packages/ui && bun run generate` (codegen → svelte + templ + `adapter/src/primitives.generated.css`).
6. **Icons** `cd packages/icons && bun run generate`.
7. **Blocks** edit `packages/blocks/defs/*` → `cd packages/blocks && bun run generate` (svelte + templ + `adapter/src/blocks.generated.css` + `classes.json`).
8. **Policy** `bun tools/ui8px-policy.ts` (after any class change) → `.ui8px/policy/*`.
9. **Apps** `bash apps/site/scripts/build.sh`; `(cd apps/design-shared && bun run generate) && (cd apps/design-svelte && bun run build)`.
10. **Gate** `bun run check` must pass before every commit. Then screenshots (`bun run shots`, `bun run shots:design`).

Generated files carry a `Code generated … DO NOT EDIT` / `Generated by …` header. Change the source (defs, recipes, mapping, records) and rerun the generator; `--check` modes fail on drift.
